-- title:
--   Joint centred Gaussian and genuine full nonlinear negative-mark stopped Ito martingale on positive initial event
-- statement:
--   For a genuine bounded-clock spatial original C2 Ito decomposition, combine any integrable Gaussian stopped physical martingale with zero conditional expectation at time 0 and the actual compensated fully nonlinear negative jump Taylor martingale. The joint sum is centred on every initial-filtration event further restricted to positive stopping time. Unlike smallmark-only gain constructions, this includes large negative marks through the original jump measure NX and nonlinear w(Y+z)-w(Y) terms.

